    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Describe how it enhances synergies and reduces trade-offs between actions taken to manage its biodiversity and climate change impacts</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Description of how the organization enhances synergies (e.g., biodiversity actions that contribute to climate change mitigation or adaptation, such as planting mangroves) and reduces trade-offs (e.g., climate change mitigation or adaptation actions that result in biodiversity loss, such as foresting an area with non-native species). If the organization does not enhance synergies or reduce trade-offs, a brief statement of this fact is sufficient to comply with the requirement.</skos:definition>
    <sds:hasUnit rdf:resource="Text"/>
    <sds:hasTemporalGranularity rdf:resource="https://sustainabilitydataspace.com/ontology#Annual"/>
  </rdf:Description>
