    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">For each site reported under 101-5-a, report the following information on affected or potentially affected ecosystems</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">For each site reported under 101-5-a, report information on affected or potentially affected ecosystems, including ecosystem type, size, and condition for the base year. Consider all ecosystem types in the area that is or could be affected by the organization's activities, including beyond its sites if relevant. The state of the overall ecosystem beyond the affected areas is not required. The size and condition of an affected ecosystem can be combined into one unit: condition-adjusted area (e.g., equivalent hectares).</skos:definition>
    <sds:hasUnit rdf:resource="Text"/>
    <sds:hasTemporalGranularity rdf:resource="https://sustainabilitydataspace.com/ontology#Annual"/>
  </rdf:Description>
