    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The disclosure required by paragraph 20 shall indicate whether and how its targets relate to the responsible management of marine resources impacts, risks and opportunities including the nature and quantity of marine resources-related commodities (such as gravels, deep-sea minerals, seafood) used by the undertaking.</skos:definition>
