    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Description of significant actual and potential negative social impacts identified in the supply chain, reported under GRI 14 sector reference to GRI 414-2-c. Significant social impacts may include those covered, among others, in employment, occupational health and safety, child labor, forced or compulsory labor, and rights of indigenous peoples, as relevant to the mining sector.</skos:definition>
