    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Confirmation or declaration regarding scope of consolidation</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">For consolidated sustainability statements, disclose either confirmation that the scope of consolidation is the same as for the financial statements, or where applicable a declaration that the reporting undertaking is not required to draw-up financial statements or is preparing consolidated sustainability reporting pursuant to Article 48i of Directive 2013/34/EU.</skos:definition>
